# Detection 01 — Repeated Failed Logins (Brute Force)

**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1110 – Brute Force
**Log Source:** Windows Security Event Log (Event ID 4625 – failed logon)

## Scenario

Simulate repeated failed login attempts against the Windows endpoint to
trigger a brute-force detection.

## Simulate It

Using Atomic Red Team (or manually): attempt to log in with an incorrect
password 5-10 times in a short window against the local account, or use
Atomic Test **T1110.001** (Password Guessing).

```
Invoke-AtomicTest T1110.001
```

## Detection Rule

See [`rules/bruteforce-failed-logins.yml`](../rules/bruteforce-failed-logins.yml)
— fires when 5+ Event ID 4625 entries occur for the same account within 5
minutes.

## Investigation Checklist (fill in with your actual findings)

